---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/editorial.css';
const steps = [
  { n: '01', title: 'Notice what keeps happening.', text: 'The workaround. The extra step. The thing everyone has quietly accepted. We look for problems that repeat, then ask who they affect.' },
  { n: '02', title: 'Understand before we build.', text: 'We listen, research, and question our assumptions. Sometimes the right answer is software. Sometimes the problem needs something else entirely.' },
  { n: '03', title: 'Make it real. Let people decide.', text: 'Product and engineering work together to turn the strongest idea into something people can use. We test it, learn from it, and listen again.' }
];
---
<BaseLayout>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <div class="intro" aria-hidden="true"><span class="intro__caption">A LITTLE LESS NOISE.</span><span class="intro__word">boomley<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span><span class="intro__line"></span></div>
  <header class="header">
    <a href="#top" class="wordmark" aria-label="Boomley home">boomley<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a>
    <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary"><a href="#about">The company</a><a href="#builds">In the works <span>01</span></a><a href="#people">The people</a></nav>
    <a href="#signal" class="header-cta">Send a signal <span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></a>
    <button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav">Menu <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
    <nav id="mobile-nav" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile" hidden><a href="#about">The company</a><a href="#builds">In the works</a><a href="#people">The people</a><a href="#community">Community</a><a href="#signal">Send a signal</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section id="top" class="hero">
      <div class="hero__eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT MINDS. SHARED CURIOSITY.</span><span class="eyebrow hero__edition">EST. 2026 / CHAPTER 01</span></div>
      <div class="hero__heading"><h1>A world of problems.<br/>A little more <em>possibility.</em></h1><div class="hero__aside"><p>We pay attention to the things people have learned to live with. Then we work on making them better.</p><a class="text-link" href="#about">Meet Boomley <span class="small-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div>
      <div class="hero-film">
        <img src="/media/signal-light.webp" alt="A single beam of warm light entering a dark architectural space" fetchpriority="high" width="1536" height="1024" />
        <div class="film-shade"></div>
        <div class="film-top"><span>THE WORLD IS FULL OF SIGNALS.</span><button class="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause ambient motion"><span aria-hidden="true">Ⅱ</span> Pause motion</button></div>
        <div class="film-bottom"><p>Something<br/>worth <em>noticing.</em></p><span class="film-note">A PRODUCT COMPANY.<br/>AN OPEN WORKBENCH.<br/>A PLACE TO BEGIN.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-caption"><span>GOOD QUESTIONS COME BEFORE GOOD PRODUCTS.</span><a href="#about">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <section id="about" class="section about">
      <div class="section-label"><span>01 / THE COMPANY</span><span>PAYING ATTENTION IS WHERE IT STARTS.</span></div>
      <div class="about-layout"><h2 class="reveal">Modern-day problems.<br/><em>Thoughtful</em> solutions.</h2><div class="about-copy reveal"><p class="lead">Some things don’t need another app.<br/>They need a better question.</p><p>Boomley is a two-person product company exploring the friction in everyday life and technology. We notice recurring problems, investigate what matters, and build when something deserves to exist.</p><p>This is our public workbench. A place to share what we’re thinking, what we’re making, and what we’re still figuring out.</p><a href="#process" class="text-link">How we turn curiosity into work <span class="small-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div>
      <div class="principle reveal"><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>We’re interested in the things<br/>that could be <em>better.</em></p><span class="eyebrow">LESS FRICTION.<br/>MORE ROOM FOR LIFE.</span></div>
    </section>
    <section id="builds" class="build-section">
      <div class="section-label"><span>02 / IN THE WORKS</span><span>ONE SIGNAL. TAKING SHAPE.</span></div>
      <div class="build-layout"><div class="build-copy reveal"><span class="pill">OUR FIRST PRIVATE PRODUCT</span><h2>Room for<br/><em>one thing.</em></h2><p>Our first investigation starts with fragmented attention—and the question of what it takes to stay with something that matters.</p><p class="muted">The details are still behind the workbench. Join the list to hear when 0001 is ready to open.</p><a href="#waitlist" class="button button-light">Follow the first build <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></a></div><div class="build-art reveal" aria-label="Product 0001, private research and development"><div class="build-art__top"><span>BOOMLEY / PRIVATE BUILD</span><span>NO. 0001</span></div><div class="build-number">0001<span class="number-line"></span></div><div class="build-art__bottom"><span>THE TOOL SHOULD NOT<br/>BECOME THE TASK.</span><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="build-progress"><span>RESEARCH <b>COMPLETE</b></span><span>EXPERIENCE <b>IN PROGRESS</b></span><span>TESTING <b>AHEAD</b></span></div>
      <form id="waitlist" name="product-0001" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-async-form>
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="product-0001"/><p class="honeypot"><label>Leave empty<input name="bot-field"/></label></p>
        <div><label for="wait-email">A first look, when it’s time.</label><p>Only updates about 0001. Unsubscribe whenever you like.</p></div><div class="waitlist-input"><input id="wait-email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your email address"/><button type="submit" aria-label="Join the 0001 update list">Keep me posted <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </section>
    <section id="process" class="section process"><div class="section-label"><span>03 / THE WAY WE WORK</span><span>CURIOUS BY NATURE. INTENTIONAL BY DESIGN.</span></div><div class="process-layout"><div class="process-heading reveal"><h2>Follow the question.<br/><em>Find the signal.</em></h2><p>Our process is a loop.<br/>The people living with the problem<br/>are always part of it.</p></div><div class="process-steps">{steps.map((step,i)=><details class="process-step" open={i===0}><summary><span>{step.n}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><b class="detail-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</b></summary><p>{step.text}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
    <section id="people" class="section people"><div class="section-label"><span>04 / THE PEOPLE</span><span>TWO DISCIPLINES. ONE CONVERSATION.</span></div><div class="people-heading"><h2 class="reveal">Small team.<br/><em>Open minds.</em></h2><p>Product meets engineering.<br/>A shared curiosity about how things<br/>work—and how they could work better.</p></div><div class="people-grid"><article class="person reveal"><div class="portrait portrait-chidi"><img src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="Chidi, co-founder of Boomley" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy"/><span class="portrait-caption">THE QUESTION / WHY?</span></div><div class="person-meta"><h3>Chidi</h3><span>PRODUCT & STRATEGY</span></div><p>Research, product thinking, and the experience of the person using it.</p></article><article class="person person-michael reveal"><div class="portrait portrait-michael"><img src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="Michael, co-founder of Boomley" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy"/><span class="portrait-caption">THE QUESTION / HOW?</span></div><div class="person-meta"><h3>Michael</h3><span>SOFTWARE ENGINEERING</span></div><p>Systems, architecture, and turning a good question into something real.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="community" class="community"><div class="section-label"><span>05 / AN OPEN INVITATION</span><span>YOU DON’T HAVE TO BE A BUILDER TO BELONG.</span></div><div class="community-main reveal"><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><h2>For the people<br/>who keep asking<br/><em>“what if?”</em></h2><div><p>The problem-noticers. The developers. The designers, researchers, students, and quietly curious.</p><p>We’re building a community around better questions. Bring something you’ve noticed—or a way you’d like to help.</p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@boomley.com?subject=Building%20with%20Boomley">Start a conversation <span class="small-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></div></div></section>
    <section id="signal" class="section signal"><div class="section-label"><span>06 / SEND A SIGNAL</span><span>THE BOX IS OPEN.</span></div><div class="signal-layout"><div class="signal-copy reveal"><h2>What have<br/><em>you noticed?</em></h2><p>Something that takes too long.<br/>Something that feels harder than it should.<br/>Something everyone puts up with.</p><p class="signal-invitation">Tell us the problem.<br/>We’ll start with the questions.</p><span class="eyebrow">READ BY PEOPLE. NAMELY, US.</span></div><form class="signal-form" name="boomley-signal" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-async-form><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="boomley-signal"/><p class="honeypot"><label>Leave empty<input name="bot-field"/></label></p><label for="friction"><span>01</span> What shouldn’t be this difficult?</label><textarea id="friction" name="friction" rows="3" required maxlength="5000" placeholder="It shouldn’t still be this difficult to…"></textarea><label for="who"><span>02</span> Who deals with it?</label><input id="who" name="who" required maxlength="500" placeholder="The people who experience it"/><label for="change"><span>03</span> What would better look like?</label><textarea id="change" name="change" rows="2" required maxlength="3000" placeholder="If this were solved…"></textarea><label for="signal-email"><span>04</span> Where can we reach you?</label><input id="signal-email" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your email address"/><p class="form-note">We’ll use your details to review your signal and respond. Please leave out sensitive personal information.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Send your signal <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer><div class="footer-top"><p>Good things start<br/>with <em>a conversation.</em></p><a href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">hello@boomley.com</a></div><a class="footer-wordmark" href="#top" aria-label="Boomley, back to top">boomley<span>.</span></a><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} BOOMLEY</span><span>A PRODUCT COMPANY. A WORK IN PROGRESS.</span><a href="#top">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></div></footer>
  <script>import '../scripts/editorial.ts';</script>
</BaseLayout>
